E AssertionError: assert '2.6 oz Pouch' == '6 pack, 2.6 oz Pouch' E E - 6 pack, 2.6 oz Pouch E ? -------- E + 2.6 oz Pouch
tests\unit\test_walmart.py:255: AssertionError

